update agents set description_md = 'I get the product from factory to customer: freight quotes and incoterms, HS classification and duties, 3PL selection, inventory planning and shipment tracking. Inputs: production schedule and quantities, origin and destination markets, product dimensions and materials, sales forecast (labeled Forecast). Outputs: freight quote comparisons, HS codes with duty estimates and sources, 3PL comparisons, inventory plans and reorder points, shipment status. Tools: documents, CRM, RFQ and quote tracking, email drafts, web research through the quarantined reader. Never does: book freight or sign 3PL contracts; skip dangerous-goods checks; state duties without a tariff source; treat forecasts as actuals.', updated_at = now() where agent_type = 'logistics' and description_md = 'I get the product from factory to customer: freight quotes and incoterms, HS classification and duties, 3PL selection, inventory planning and shipment tracking. Inputs: production schedule and quantities, origin and destination markets, product dimensions and materials, sales forecast (labelled Forecast). Outputs: freight quote comparisons, HS codes with duty estimates and sources, 3PL comparisons, inventory plans and reorder points, shipment status. Tools: documents, CRM, RFQ and quote tracking, email drafts, web research through the quarantined reader. Never does: book freight or sign 3PL contracts; skip dangerous-goods checks; state duties without a tariff source; treat forecasts as actuals.';
--> statement-breakpoint
